{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c83aa86d91790f8742435e70db186cfb0a7ed5c02d4c447657d663ea33bf60dd", "ja": "仕事が順調なのにどこか元気のないエレナ。\n理由を尋ねると、弟と母がルーツの違いから\n喧嘩している事を話す。落ち込むエレナだっ\nたが、互いの気持ちを伝えるにはアイドルの\nエレナにしかできない方法があると気付く。", "zh": "工作明明很顺利，艾莲娜却总显得有些无精打采。\n询问理由后，她透露是因为弟弟和母亲因文化背景的\n差异而吵了架。虽然艾莲娜感到很沮丧，\n但她意识到还有唯有身为偶像的艾莲娜\n才能做到的方法，可以向彼此传达心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63d4eef1519ea5b58024ca564f6033f16abada9f29c671a152ee10c4cdecb21a", "ja": "（エレナが出演する、例の番組の収録が始まった。\nバラエティは独特の緊張感があるな……）", "zh": "（艾丽娜出演的那档节目开始录制了。综艺节目还真有种独特的紧张感……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "3f52aab23dd4e898dc6304249db0fc113280f718b1fe845508ace6c1aec66567", "ja": "本日のゲスト、島原エレナさんです！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "今天的嘉宾是岛原艾琳娜先生！\n请多多关照——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "6001f488638437f16a54418b4348abedf75163ee5776f7769abf9ddf0b63319a", "ja": "アイドルの、島原エレナです！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "偶像的岛原艾琳娜！\n请多关照——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1003_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "74d3cabbc897813ca30d9bb3bc2bcb2336f8307ca7e5055b80f421c977a3a2b0", "ja": "う～ん、やっぱり島原さんがいると、\nスタジオが一際明るくなった感じがするねえ！", "zh": "嗯～果然有岛原小姐在，感觉摄影棚一下子变得格外明亮了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "8ab6387db521bc9d980d236cf313ea8e70adb27801237ef619b7a3942d27f95c", "ja": "本当ですか？　ありがとうございます！", "zh": "真的吗？谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1005_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "774d7022273f172506276d8bf7dd8dd335a01d4e7ea989b62a2987ef08253afc", "ja": "う～ん、爽やかですね！　これは次の番組改変で、\nレギュラー入りも夢じゃないかも……！", "zh": "嗯～真清爽啊！这样下去，说不定下次节目改版时就能成为常驻嘉宾了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1006_shikaisya", "source_sha256": "f0de6506a80e5a84ef7a2be4206832f7525a5217e62bd2b0d1bf467b7ad6ae1f", "ja": "今日はクイズもあるので、頑張ってくださいね！", "zh": "今天还有问答环节，请加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "c997a9fc2d741e92f9e80a7e2021b3a0b0b3fc1eb3bb6a9db000b29e1068477a", "ja": "ハ～イ！　ワタシ、がんばります♪", "zh": "好——！我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1008_null", "source_sha256": "80c3925b1b7dde72895b54468fcc1b119f4dff637abea1611cc1628b02cd84e0", "ja": "番組終了後……", "zh": "节目结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4144867ed534208b1cfb4acc4d97a65899f77c218bfab3d8c010f40a2d6404c6", "ja": "エレナ、お疲れさま！\n無事終わったな。", "zh": "艾莲娜，辛苦了！\n顺利结束了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1010_p", "source_sha256": "651deb9ded797abcd38e5ba7bcd2a4ea5214a91a41ab0c7fe07686efb07ab841", "ja": "出演者の人にも、スタッフさん達にも好感触だったよ。\nみんな期待してくれてるし、ここは頑張らないとな。", "zh": "出演者和工作人员们的反响都很好。\n大家都对我们抱有期待，这下可得加把劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "ebe09e62da71c56b222e372334bf0a5a17553bc5cfa2fc5692a9cb5def9f9d57", "ja": "うん、がんばるヨー！\n……はぁ。", "zh": "嗯，我会加油的唷——！\n……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1012_p", "source_sha256": "6031c95d5226e816e48051379ec483f59b2fe6f639abf69ddd7e6c154c686afc", "ja": "？　仕事は上手くいったのに、浮かない顔だな。\n何かあったのか？", "zh": "？工作明明进展得很顺利，你看起来却闷闷不乐。发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "1253af146f6e0ebf34ff1e482f8658b235cfbb1e9bf4886a62ef4402b6581904", "ja": "うん……でも、お仕事と関係ないコトだから。\nプライベートなんだヨ～。", "zh": "嗯……不过，这和工作没关系。\n是私事啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8183c1e4b4d341bd03efa48af63f692aba901a81c065745fb0133dfdfef97651", "ja": "仕事に関係ない事でもいいよ。\nエレナが悩んでるなら、いつだって相談に乗るさ。", "zh": "就算是和工作无关的事情也没关系。只要是艾莲娜在烦恼，不管什么时候我都愿意听你倾诉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b0f20d29750aa0602c2d21ecba6b09e37ed1ce503eb936d424a6b3eaed9b458c", "ja": "あ、でも話したくない事なら、\n無理にとは言わないけど……。", "zh": "啊，不过要是不想说的话，\n我也不会勉强你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "7a7977c8cc0ada302911cb4939124beeff082e06ee69f096e338633ef4ef0f4d", "ja": "ううん！　全然、そんなコトないヨ。ワタシ、\n{$P$}に聞いてほしかったもん……。", "zh": "不是的！完全不是那回事啦。我一直想让{$P$}听我说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1017_p", "source_sha256": "4817ec362270524e6b706ee8669731e863a1d8982fa40fe77cdd468affde9e5d", "ja": "そうか。だったら遠慮しなくていいぞ。", "zh": "这样啊。那就不用客气了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc27bbc2372aa18c68e9228655a283971a34d126127221972172b5a9538c7074", "ja": "ありがと……\nじゃあちょっとだけ、聞いてほしいナ……。", "zh": "谢谢……\n那就听我说一会儿，好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1019_null", "source_sha256": "0546fd711979f94d27a7ef72d264f04bb48591353a72781f6ccb75f8f93a345b", "ja": "先日、弟を追いかけた後……", "zh": "前几天，追着弟弟跑之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "6dca3b33b26d7310e21717335c98a2741a084e6a71f0f23761cc6b1950161126", "ja": "ジョアン！　……はぁ、はぁ……\nやっぱりここにいたんだネ。", "zh": "乔安！……呼、呼……\n你果然在这里呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1021_joan", "source_sha256": "8d9a4394e90f62a67501d43a513991f0656e4e17f2a9a6118cfc8b892d6c6b0e", "ja": "お姉ちゃん……。", "zh": "姐姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "a65db8041c55e888cc8432617427c05374979f3cc740d76579fc6b7e5780a9b6", "ja": "ママンに、どうしてあんなひどいコト言ったの？\nそれに、最近毎日ケンカしてるし……。", "zh": "你为什么要对妈妈说那么过分的话？\n而且，最近还每天都在吵架……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "102fe7ca3ec0a28ac012b22c3c19a0226dc8854a94ff88e49f15f5a8960f8e49", "ja": "ねえ、何があったノ？", "zh": "那个，到底发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1024_joan", "source_sha256": "33157d6224e68e368871f4f648087fd1feb30b30f563c15808bdb5fce1dc2cae", "ja": "何かっていうか……いろいろ。", "zh": "要说是什么嘛……各种各样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1025_018ele", "source_sha256": "aca0ccef0a33ec8469221d6b64ff3f4b5096e15d23225013d0b723f3b386547a", "ja": "むー……お姉ちゃんにも話せないコト？", "zh": "唔……是连姐姐都不能说的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1026_joan", "source_sha256": "9f4fc237772556b9bcfc9cd27ecf0e1ff82d6d5f766eb5565c70f861c8ec4b1f", "ja": "違うよ、そうじゃなくて。……オレ、受験生だろ。\nなのにお母さん、全然気にしてないし。", "zh": "不是的，不是那样。……我可是考生啊。\n可妈妈却完全不在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1027_joan", "source_sha256": "5dd397e6bff0bdecc778737d6121f434f6699de2544471da9c022d05072c6020", "ja": "今度、進路相談で親が学校に来なきゃなんだけど。\nお母さんには来てほしくないって……。", "zh": "下次家长得来学校参加升学咨询。  \n可是……我不想让妈妈来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1028_joan", "source_sha256": "9c01b8c228c3dc3e5648e87ad158502ae25df5495f2a3fa1ed53e9c27c3cc51a", "ja": "どうせ来たって、話の内容わからないでしょって。\nそう言ったら、ケンカになったり……。", "zh": "“反正来了也听不懂我们在说什么吧。”我这么一说，结果就吵了起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "0f8dbe23a0605de8ac83fae218fd10e9c9a8eed8b5c6eed7b6e92598afebd6f1", "ja": "ええー！？\nジョアン……どうしてそんなコト言ったノ？", "zh": "诶——！？  \n乔安……你为什么要说那种话呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1030_joan", "source_sha256": "6496d491e034bc73aa0572fe47495d8b1ef84ec4d86c27ffbbcdc0acc1c414ae", "ja": "オレだってわかってるよ、ひどいコト言ったって！\nでもお母さん、日常会話以外、日本語話せないじゃん！", "zh": "我也知道自己说了过分的话啊！\n可是妈妈，除了日常对话以外，你根本不会说日语吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1031_joan", "source_sha256": "036d05a5d4d7a3cc5e70cd34a9842a36c23a20d7b5347ee9867b6650a13111c8", "ja": "学校に来たって、先生と話通じないだろ。……また\nオレが、通訳しながら喋らなきゃいけないのかなって。", "zh": "就算来了学校，也跟老师沟通不了吧。……我还以为，\n又得由我一边翻译一边跟老师说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1032_018ele", "source_sha256": "b40b360ef868a115876ee11fcd88ec68ca3af63657ef4715957f37202ca7a438", "ja": "……そっか。たしかに、日本の受験のコトとか、\nママンにはわからないよね……う～ん……。", "zh": "……这样啊。确实，关于日本升学考试的事情，\n妈妈完全弄不明白呢……唔～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "a99dd35e856674389490e90e8c9767aa7459fba1e0b35fd6b76e78b812a1d669", "ja": "あっ、パパンは！？　相談してみたノ？", "zh": "啊，爸爸呢！？有去找他商量过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1034_joan", "source_sha256": "5f8863277ddb93e9d07c2dee6ab3fbd169e4627bd50e5281adb3638cdd654c05", "ja": "お父さん、今ブラジルに出張中じゃん。\n面談には来られないし……。", "zh": "爸爸现在正在巴西出差嘛。\n没法来参加面谈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1035_joan", "source_sha256": "0acb3258cb86cdf4d96f2473fb8c05ba4814dbf381ba2b0c901032e3294c7369", "ja": "……お姉ちゃんは困った事があった時、誰に相談\nしてるの。お母さんじゃわからない事もあるでしょ。", "zh": "……姐姐遇到烦恼的时候，会找谁商量呢？总有些事情是妈妈也不明白的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1036_018ele", "source_sha256": "d626ac4be87d1b7082fa7c692762c783805ed0536d36db4b76239291a0d6848d", "ja": "ワタシ？　ワタシは、友達とか、劇場のみんなとか……\nあとは、{$P$}かナ？", "zh": "我吗？我会找朋友、剧场里的大家……还有，就是{$P$}吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "776782400c05b891144baf3ff7613889b4cb2b2f89faa36d1081d35aad21bd6d", "ja": "劇場にはいろんな人がいるから、\nとっても参考になるヨ！", "zh": "剧场里有形形色色的人，\n所以能学到很多东西哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1038_joan", "source_sha256": "d86e3478af581f6f675868403ca730533d3014017b6c7ed8772fb35f35062088", "ja": "でも、オレ達みたいにダブルの人はいないんでしょ？", "zh": "不过，像我们这样的双人组合，应该没有吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1039_joan", "source_sha256": "51a8887169622728681924a9163ac66906166ddbfa20556aa233bc1ebe2dc58c", "ja": "前に言ってたよね、イギリス人の女の子がいるって。\nでもオレやお姉ちゃんは、それとはちょっと違うし。", "zh": "你之前说过吧，说有个英国女孩。可是，我和姐姐跟她有点不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1040_018ele", "source_sha256": "303c610e94e84b2fe5988adcabd6066443491cd93f07e18c522ceed890044713", "ja": "えっ……あ、うん。", "zh": "诶……啊，嗯。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1041_joan", "source_sha256": "fcfa87a64230f532934b97f5361f21101ec145a5625036d7ec8f3d30d8eb7b1b", "ja": "オレ、小さい頃からみんなと違うのが気になってて……\n日本人なのに、外国人だって目で見られるじゃん。", "zh": "我从小就很在意自己和大家不一样……\n明明是日本人，却总是被人当成外国人看待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1042_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1043_joan", "source_sha256": "1133d732b7e5e575e91bd0b3a15b74a1548e70e4a7e3b88e820e0531c38b7c93", "ja": "何？", "zh": "怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1044_018ele", "source_sha256": "818e1107a8329a80d6ce0f793b8239675df16a60990b2bd4b7f02e8ab1daac1e", "ja": "あ、ううん。今日、{$P$}とも\nそういう話になったんだヨ。", "zh": "啊，不，今天也和{$P$}聊到了这个话题哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "b51a02891b80f59398f08626b8103a3a931b226923f75ab053aebab0495da73d", "ja": "次のお仕事で、レギュラーが決まりそうなんだけど。\nそれが、外国にルーツがある人の枠だって。", "zh": "下一个工作好像就要确定成为固定出演了。\n听说是有外国血统的人的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1046_joan", "source_sha256": "37ccb3ec0428db16ec5132fd5fa95dd39ffaac07b36e12c6b43dc12724621868", "ja": "……やっぱり、どこでも言われるんだね。", "zh": "……果然到哪儿都会被这么说呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1047_018ele", "source_sha256": "56fa7f55f0f35ff8189c36a87be14c81a0e1a5903104a41b5ff27dec61e3f369", "ja": "うん。でも、ワタシはワタシだから。\n大丈夫だよって、{$P$}に言ったヨ！", "zh": "嗯。不过，我就是我。\n我对{$P$}说了“没关系哦”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1048_018ele", "source_sha256": "7d477abc9b690913515f30356c956cba076614cb0b3754d7cba2d5b0956886a7", "ja": "それに、ワタシがイヤだって思うお仕事を、\n{$P$}が選ぶわけないしネ。", "zh": "而且，{$P$}也不可能会选择让我觉得讨厌的工作嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1049_joan", "source_sha256": "1baec2efa339f08983318980b5a81f1c59d71416437ffa0a7f06683181486053", "ja": "そうなんだ。……お姉ちゃんは、\n信頼できる大人が近くにいていいな。", "zh": "原来是这样。……姐姐身边有值得信赖的大人，真好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1050_018ele", "source_sha256": "8044ef24c34fc69b2f79cd457e701a4a329d0f65538bc87ad001c876a509c2e8", "ja": "ジョアン……。", "zh": "乔安……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1052_p", "source_sha256": "f592ca7a7392709cbe072f46ad0766270edcab37c3d028df2fb48daf798bcbc5", "ja": "なるほど。\n信頼できる大人か……。", "zh": "原来如此。\n值得信赖的大人吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1053_018ele", "source_sha256": "9b6947b1f1685fee727ef01d8cef72997cf01a69d675a85e60644c091174c040", "ja": "弟も、{$P$}に\n相談できればいいのかナ？", "zh": "我弟弟也找{$P$}\n商量一下比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1054_p", "source_sha256": "93aa7e039229d48453a0bc68086d56b3bc5adcba0b665d6538c69d4011c727f1", "ja": "相談には乗れるけど、進路だしな。弟さん本人の事、\n性格をよく知っている大人がいた方がいいと思う。", "zh": "我可以帮忙出主意，不过毕竟是升学方向的事。我觉得，还是有了解你弟弟本人和性格的成年人在身边比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1055_p", "source_sha256": "554e33b24d6b85e20ee9b7626505bc4798f5bb2040f30ba1010a16a22eed2827", "ja": "学校の先生とか、俺よりもっと\n適任な人がいるとは思うんだけど……。", "zh": "像学校老师之类的，应该会有\n比我更合适的人选才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1056_018ele", "source_sha256": "1e03a38bded170f2bbb3b1e533067722cbc68d31e6836d8c827d0bc0d575d697", "ja": "学校の先生とも、あんまり話せてないみたい。\n……それに、ママンが学校に来るのが恥ずかしいって。", "zh": "好像也没怎么和学校老师说上话。\n……而且，她说妈妈来学校会让她觉得丢脸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1057_018ele", "source_sha256": "398ac5e1c245aabf95fc847c9ec4f9aa00cb97de142f83efc001e054f679546f", "ja": "ママンは日本語が上手じゃないから、\n難しいコト言われてもわからないのは本当だし……。", "zh": "因为妈妈的日语说得不好，所以就算别人跟她说些难懂的话，她听不懂也是事实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1058_018ele", "source_sha256": "45d16190e58f7a8805cbf8d942128e83f37fe15080f53c3c786e037345fac4e2", "ja": "あ、でも弟のコトを考えてないワケじゃないんだヨ？\n幸せになってほしいって、いつも言ってるし！", "zh": "啊，不过我也不是没考虑过弟弟的事哦？\n我一直都在说，希望他能幸福！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1059_p", "source_sha256": "433e06c35b8ff57f658a8dc8451843febda08fe335f323ce7884d1a6879171e3", "ja": "うん……わかるよ。", "zh": "嗯……我明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1060_p", "source_sha256": "cd5228baa610f6de3e1b119f8b85bc073ca346c4190c2b683a75b3a811a6c137", "ja": "（エレナのご両親には会った事がある。あの人達が、\n自分の子ども達の将来を気にかけないはずがない）", "zh": "（我见过艾蕾娜的父母。他们不可能不关心自己孩子们的未来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1061_018ele", "source_sha256": "0595fca3902f7a482654aec0d7be781c79eba25d0b0137e30a61501a2fe90c67", "ja": "弟だって、ママンのそういうところは、\nわかってると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我觉得弟弟也明白妈妈的那一面，\n只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1062_p", "source_sha256": "27c64d6245c3d88df5d61c77db82a972b24c0180c97aabdcac5f493a3b228026", "ja": "うん。……なあ、エレナ。\n少し突っ込んだ事を聞くけど……。", "zh": "嗯。……那个，艾莲娜。\n我想问个比较深入的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1063_p", "source_sha256": "af9fa7a98ecfb1f47c5d51505603bf9324c523435fa1609d3061e3d197c5f74d", "ja": "エレナは、外国にルーツがあるのを\n嫌だと思った事はあるのか？", "zh": "你有没有曾经因为自己有外国血统，而感到讨厌？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1064_018ele", "source_sha256": "1bd938530a3a3918f544359067cb17d0570fba1a2e2cffb51b1ecfce19c0b6bd", "ja": "う～ん……。みんなには、ナイショだよ？\nちょっとだけ、さみしいって思ったコトはあるかナ。", "zh": "嗯……要对大家保密哦？\n我也有过那么一点点寂寞的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1065_018ele", "source_sha256": "ae04f8aaa2cf1f4057e86c67b2de5b757cdad0d3e848628a46038be8e56fb86b", "ja": "目が青いからだと思うんだけど……初めて会った人に、\n「外国の人なのかな？」って思われるでしょ？", "zh": "我觉得是因为我的眼睛是蓝色的吧……第一次见到我的人，都会觉得：“她是不是外国人呀？”对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1066_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ebf1817972fe2347d1e6970c0c555dd37b0838c4236e6c39541804650da4d74", "ja": "そういう時にね、ちょっとだけ……\nワタシはみんなと違うのかナ、って思うコトはあるヨ。", "zh": "这种时候呢，偶尔会有那么一点……觉得自己是不是和大家不太一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1067_018ele", "source_sha256": "8a540d4253df3def2ebd9b7b2191dd611515f2415c0d6921cdcdb5d45524b0be", "ja": "ワタシはブラジルと日本の間に生まれて、\n今は日本で暮らしてる。それだけなんだけどネ。", "zh": "我出生在巴西和日本之间，现在生活在日本。就只是这样而已啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1068_p", "source_sha256": "7a783191fa147d84441b1bf8e41d861ddd978f5755c9370eebf13e9a3a9c2551", "ja": "そうだな。\n世界中のどこにいたって、エレナはエレナだ。", "zh": "是啊。\n无论身处世界的哪个角落，艾蕾娜就是艾蕾娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1069_018ele", "source_sha256": "ebf48e5f88b43a399df5a3c1500f6d4125af980ff87db82d838a4121515cf52a", "ja": "でしょ？　エヘヘ。", "zh": "对吧？嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1070_018ele", "source_sha256": "31fed65be8a37a6fd9f0bf1afd65c8b3866a116a5f8951ca2b9acab6d9e9aac7", "ja": "でも……だから、思うんだ。\nワタシって、冷たいのかナって……。", "zh": "但是……所以我在想，\n我是不是……有点冷漠呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1071_018ele", "source_sha256": "01cc020a29cd363d7aabec6aa67017ba8b2662e91c16762a3f8c3485038a1f41", "ja": "お姉ちゃんなのに、弟の……ジョアンの気持ち、\nあんまりわかってあげられてないヨ……。", "zh": "明明是姐姐，却没能很好地理解弟弟……若昂的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1072_p", "source_sha256": "9d2dc33aa116eb8d068e945448777602cb3abac7fae5d4c4b6c15fd1429934f3", "ja": "（エレナは人一倍寂しがりだからな。だからこそ、\n周りの寂しそうな子にも、すぐに気がつく……）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜比一般人更容易感到寂寞。正因如此，她也总能立刻注意到身边那些看起来很寂寞的孩子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1073_p", "source_sha256": "dfb91b058aebe7ce033f7a1bd452b79d653e9d157b966377ba339962007e0156", "ja": "本当に冷たい人は、そんな心配しないさ。\nエレナは優しいお姉さんだと思うよ。", "zh": "真正冷漠的人，才不会担心这些呢。\n我觉得艾丽娜是个温柔的大姐姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1074_p", "source_sha256": "00fad13925f3e8f282c2c67b58c3ccb93c215226cbb4dab3e520ea6c7c76ecd0", "ja": "それに、弟さんと同じような寂しさだって感じてる。\n気持ちは、わかってあげられていると思うな。", "zh": "而且，你也感受着和弟弟一样的寂寞。\n我觉得，你应该能够理解他的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1076_018ele", "source_sha256": "dfd966db1c1ad69dee108845b128dd6ca72046e5802eab590841c9e6818e5329", "ja": "う～……でも。どうしたらいいんだろう？\nジョアンもママンも、誰も悪くないのに……。", "zh": "呜～……可是，我该怎么办才好呢？\n明明乔安和妈妈都没有错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1077_p", "source_sha256": "b0c9444985d628cb9404501a2de0e9bc6dd3790aa9829f18f0077392d09409e8", "ja": "誰も悪くない、確かにそのとおりだな……悪くないのに\nわかり合えない。人間は本来、ひとりだから。", "zh": "没有人有错，这确实没错……没有人有错，却无法相互理解。人本来就是孤独的个体。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1078_p", "source_sha256": "fdb491827efd97d0930ce8287537314c67011c8fc246f030e4521170707d59dc", "ja": "でも、だからこそ……\n自分以外の人を、大切に思えるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "可是，正因为如此……\n才会更加珍惜自己以外的人吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1079_018ele", "source_sha256": "b706e720ed717d66d1e2eda3638a94837c6d3a964a955795d32edcb6f2e89da5", "ja": "うう……{$P$}、\n急に難しいコト言わないで……。", "zh": "呜呜……{$P$}，\n不要突然说这么难懂的话嘛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1080_p", "source_sha256": "4eb1de7d5e115b81fac0995334555b54432266568feeb8ffd2c01e184a7aed9e", "ja": "ごめん。エレナの弟さんは、本当はお母さんの事が\n大好きなんじゃないか、って話だよ。", "zh": "抱歉。我是说，艾莲娜的弟弟其实可能很喜欢妈妈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1081_p", "source_sha256": "7513e96ca0c867599359095b25015412248ec558ad1f113f76aaf935633d3fd6", "ja": "大好きな人に言葉が通じない、わかってもらえない。\nだからもどかしい……そういう事なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "最喜欢的人听不懂自己的语言，无法理解自己的心情。\n所以才会感到焦躁……是不是这么回事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1082_018ele", "source_sha256": "8b5966c885fe5c17a7a5431bc3299da52587fa8a021eb3a85e7c673ef341275a", "ja": "大好きな人だから……。", "zh": "正因为是最喜欢的人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1083_p", "source_sha256": "06cecbff1ee8dd05d063dca8449c155dddc19d99837c59f7e6ec5348cfb9bcf1", "ja": "弟さんは、もしかしたらご両親に\n「悩んでる」って事を言い辛いのかもしれないな。", "zh": "你弟弟或许很难向父母\n开口说自己“有烦恼”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1084_p", "source_sha256": "4bc59fd5d49204c28e41f0c2a1dfbdfe8c3483df870de3025b21fb2fcd3dd950", "ja": "矛盾してるようだけど、弟さんには「心配を掛けたく\nない」って気持ちもあると思うんだ。男の子だしな。", "zh": "这听起来可能有点矛盾，但我觉得弟弟也有\"不想让人担心\"的心情。毕竟是男孩子嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1085_p", "source_sha256": "6171107599a171bac680c44a0c26f801e32053c75681ecd4dbec43682f1e26a9", "ja": "エレナだって、心配掛けたくなくて、\n俺に相談しないでいただろ？　きっと同じだよ。", "zh": "就连艾蕾娜也是因为不想让人担心，才没有来找我商量吧？肯定是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1086_018ele", "source_sha256": "1bc253a215ae895394c9cc3707fd71149f4967da92814272f1f1a9ed119f0437", "ja": "あ……そっか。", "zh": "啊……这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1087_p", "source_sha256": "2ebc01e22087e4275f0393d730f5e847c1522c1e45274364df6923f527663745", "ja": "もちろん、エレナのご両親なら、どんな話でも\nまっすぐに受け止めてくれると思うけどな。", "zh": "当然，要是艾莲娜的父母，我想不管你说什么，\n他们都会坦率接纳的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1088_018ele", "source_sha256": "ce1d708d63fc6ab49b164673619388f081a5fc519e8be6dc77d7a1066156be39", "ja": "うん。ワタシも、そう思うヨ！\nちゃんと話したら、絶対大丈夫だって……。", "zh": "嗯。我也这么觉得哟！\n只要好好说清楚，就绝对没问题的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1089_018ele", "source_sha256": "33b146b38684c8dc939dad413ad043398dcefad13f1c9ddc2efbd74c0d40ab90", "ja": "あとは、仲直りの方法だネ！\nでも、ふたりともすっごく頑固なんだヨ～。", "zh": "接下来就是想办法和好啦！\n不过，两个人都特别固执呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1090_p", "source_sha256": "0141e9ae2413473929312bb7c705ce3084f44e74da578a3f958a141388e233d0", "ja": "コミュニケーションには、いろんな方法があるはずだ。\n中には、エレナが得意な事もな！", "zh": "沟通应该有很多种方式。其中也有艾蕾娜擅长的事嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1091_018ele", "source_sha256": "eb97db828f8bfa30ecaebc2080219b90ce890724d32544a59069c350234e2083", "ja": "ワタシが、得意なコト？\nえーと……あっ。そっか！", "zh": "我擅长的事？\n呃……啊，对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1092_p", "source_sha256": "70ead495d5e46a2df64053f79299e94ce16b1ea2a55c94a16f5d34231028f74d", "ja": "うん。弟さんとお母さんが、一緒にいて\n楽しい気持ちになれるように。公演に来てもらおうか。", "zh": "嗯。为了能让弟弟和妈妈在一起时\n感到开心，不如请他们来看演出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1093_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd95b1526c630d02bf1385f3f6471d58d4f66a5146d29f84427c25c7ff6ac269", "ja": "{$P$}……ありがと！\nダイスキ！", "zh": "{$P$}……谢谢！\n最喜欢你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1094_p", "source_sha256": "f84a184b1c69b8bb4791d8297182a39776afbac16917916f4ac07946cd7bf7b9", "ja": "わっ！？　エレナ、\n急に飛びついたら危ない……！", "zh": "哇！？艾莲娜，\n突然扑过来很危险的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1095_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1096_018ele", "source_sha256": "27ee1362f02587f2ea2eb11f4adc81c797c6ec30905e3eb4018b1b1fc05691b5", "ja": "みんなー！\n今日は劇場に来てくれて、本当にありがとー！", "zh": "大家——！\n今天真的非常感谢你们来到剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_128_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_128_1097_018ele", "source_sha256": "223193a26db6955105fa00da92f1a13bc728589e4c8b0e2f4768211a62cae9b9", "ja": "それじゃ、いくよ～！\nワタシといっしょに、踊ろうネっ♪", "zh": "那么，要开始咯～！和我一起跳舞吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
